  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAssetsAndLiabilitiesIncurredFromTransactionsWithAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※２  関係会社に対する金銭債権及び金銭債務&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:27pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
